1
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,980
Snowflakes made of neon light,

2
00:00:22,980 --> 00:00:26,870
falling slow on the chrome tonight.

3
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:33,230
Lavender glow on your silhouette,

4
00:00:33,230 --> 00:00:37,510
city heartbeat syncs with our breath.

5
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:44,000
Digital trees hum in pink and blue,

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,850
hologram stars flicker over you.

7
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:51,450
Cold air bites but it feels so warm,

8
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:56,490
’cause your hand fits mine in the storm.

9
00:00:57,290 --> 00:01:01,400
Electric pulse between our skin,

10
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:06,670
soft like a memory waking in.

11
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:11,560
Every spark is whispering slow—

12
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:17,060
“Baby, don’t let go…”

13
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:21,280
In this neon winter Christmas night,

14
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:23,740
you and I are glowing bright.

15
00:01:23,740 --> 00:01:27,740
Hot pink lights and lavender skies,

16
00:01:27,740 --> 00:01:30,440
love rewrites the world tonight.

17
00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:33,330
Frost and circuits, heartbeat fire—

18
00:01:33,330 --> 00:01:37,550
you’re my only warm desire.

19
00:01:37,550 --> 00:01:43,590
Neon snow keeps falling down,

20
00:01:43,970 --> 00:01:48,010
but you’re the light I’ve found.

21
00:01:59,820 --> 00:02:02,230
Footprints melt on the mirrored street,

22
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:04,800
synth bells ring with a glitchy beat.

23
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:09,020
Reflection dancing on silver air,

24
00:02:09,970 --> 00:02:13,200
your smile, the brightest signal there.

25
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:15,670
Cold wires hum like a quiet hymn,

26
00:02:15,670 --> 00:02:19,420
soft shadows blur at the city rim.

27
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:24,930
Even in a world built out of chrome—

28
00:02:24,930 --> 00:02:29,480
with you… I’m finally home.

29
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:35,490
Let the current guide us slow,

30
00:02:35,860 --> 00:02:40,990
through the dark where the warm lights glow.

31
00:02:40,990 --> 00:02:44,890
Hold me close in the neon haze—

32
00:02:44,890 --> 00:02:50,170
love feels real in electric ways.

33
00:02:50,480 --> 00:02:54,570
In this neon winter Christmas night,

34
00:02:54,570 --> 00:02:57,180
you and I are glowing bright.

35
00:02:57,180 --> 00:03:01,240
Pink and lavender through the cold,

36
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,800
warmest story never told.

37
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:06,750
Frozen city, pulsing heart—

38
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:10,960
we were never worlds apart.

39
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:16,980
Neon snow keeps falling down…

40
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:21,360
but you’re the light I’ve found.

